[36m(TaskRunner pid=97012)[0m Use `<think>` to briefly reason about the current state, product fit, voucher interpretation, and the next tool action. In `DECISION`, keep a short checklist with one entry per requested product and mark supported versus missing SKU/service/attribute constraints.
